WEBVTT

00:00:00.753 --> 00:00:02.886
<v><b>Jane:</b></v> Hello. My name’s Jane.

00:00:03.170 --> 00:00:05.761
<v><b>Expert:</b></v> Hi, Jane. So, why are you calling?

00:00:06.244 --> 00:00:10.906
<v><b>Jane:</b></v> Well, a month ago, my friend Susan and I decided to go on holiday together

00:00:10.931 --> 00:00:12.727
this summer, to Italy.

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:18.131
So we planned everything and, er, I was really looking forward to it,

00:00:18.156 --> 00:00:21.250
as Susan’s an old friend and I don’t see her very often.

00:00:21.786 --> 00:00:26.917
But the other day, she told me that she was telling another friend of hers about our holiday –

00:00:26.977 --> 00:00:32.303
somebody I don’t know, a woman called Angie – and Angie was really interested,

00:00:32.443 --> 00:00:35.343
and now Susan has invited her to come, too.

00:00:35.561 --> 00:00:39.660
Susan never asked me what I thought! I don’t even know Angie,

00:00:39.966 --> 00:00:43.900
and I really don’t want to go on holiday with someone I don’t know.

00:00:44.033 --> 00:00:45.146
What should I do?